      "narration": "Another way to compare: change each fraction into an equivalent fraction with the LCM of the denominators. Then compare them by Rule 1. For 5 by 6 and 8 by 9, the LCM of 6 and 9 is 18. 5 by 6 is 15 by 18, and 8 by 9 is 16 by 18. 15 by 18 is less than 16 by 18, so 5 by 6 is less than 8 by 9.",
